# Celery beat's local schedule-tracking file (SQLite shm/wal are its write-ahead-log
# siblings) - written next to wherever `celery beat` runs, lands in the repo root
# because docker-compose bind-mounts the repo into the celery_beat container.
celerybeat-schedule
celerybeat-schedule-shm
celerybeat-schedule-wal

